  "description": "Freeman BN18-2 18G.Nail 2 in. 1K Blister Pack - Distributed/Packaged by Freeman. Product Details: The Freeman 18-Gauge 2\" Glue Collated Brad Nails (1,000 Count) are built for strength and precision in finish carpentry applications like fastening thicker trim, moulding, and baseboards. These narrow-head brad nails offer exceptional holding power with minimal visibility, helping achieve a clean, professional finish. Made from galvanized steel to resist rust and corrosion, they’re ideal for indoor woodworking, cabinetry, and detailed trim work. The glue-collated strips provide smooth feeding and help prevent jamming in nailers. These nails are compatible with most 18-gauge brad nailers that fire 2\" glue collated brads, including Freeman’s PE20V31618G, PE20V2118G2, PE20VBR50, G2XL31, and G2BR50. Each box contains 1,000 brad nails, giving you plenty of fasteners for your next finishing project.",
